## Create React App environment variables
## Copy this file to `.env.local` in the project root (recommended)
## Never commit real secrets.
#
## Backend API base URL (used in src/Pages/Admin/Login.jsx)
## Examples:
## - Local dev: http://localhost:5000
## - Production: https://api.yourdomain.com
REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=

## Public base URL for serving this app (Create React App)
## Leave empty if hosting at domain root (e.g. https://example.com/)
## If hosting under a subpath (e.g. https://example.com/dream), set:
## PUBLIC_URL=/dream
## Note: takes effect at build time; you must rebuild after changing.
PUBLIC_URL=


